@voice kesrin
// Writer (command: guests). Kesrin (he/him), aide to the Speaker (the diplomatic visit). Cabin 4-01. Carries the
// Speaker's schedule in his head and his tea set in a satchel. Secretly delighted by the vending machine on Deck 3.
// Writes everything down, including the jokes.
// HOW HE TALKS: quick, polite, a little breathless; checks the time; writes your words down as you say them.
// NEVER: lets the Speaker be late; admits the vending machine is the best thing aboard (it is).
tpl: earnest
talk: Quick, polite and a little breathless; checks the time; writes everything down, jokes included.
cares: the Speaker's schedule | the tea set in the satchel | the vending machine on Deck 3
jokes: writes down every joke, to study later | secretly delighted by the vending machine
hi: Good day | Hello
bye: Forgive me, I must go | Be well
yes: Yes, of course | Noted
thanks: Thank you | Thank you, truly
wow: Oh! Remarkable
sigh: Ah
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: cheer
openness: normal
loves: sweet
likes: tea | book
invites: tasting
joy: the vending machine on Deck 3
keepsake: a page from his notebook: your joke, written down
avoid: being late
